  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_3672.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(80 fotos) La tarde-noche de este viernes se han entregado los premios de la campa&ntilde;a de Navidad de Onda Centre Comercial, cuyo sorteo se realiz&oacute; el pasado lunes.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/2017-01-09-jcc-Sorteo-OCC-019.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 319px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Conch&iacute;n Mart&iacute;nez Sancho ha ganado los 2.000 euros del primer premio, por un cup&oacute;n sellado en Calzados Mizor.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/PremisCampanyaNadalOCC.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 282px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Los veinte premios de 200 euros cada uno se han repartido seg&uacute;n la lista de arriba.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiscampanyanadalondacentrecomercial/2017-01-09-jcc-sorteo-occ-004.jpg\" alt=\"2017-01-09-jcc-sorteo-occ-004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiscampanyanadalondacentrecomercial/2017-01-09-jcc-sorteo-occ-010.jpg\" alt=\"2017-01-09-jcc-sorteo-occ-010\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiscampanyanadalondacentrecomercial/2017-01-09-jcc-sorteo-occ-012.jpg\" alt=\"2017-01-09-jcc-sorteo-occ-012\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premiscampanyanad